  "title": "Content Credential Signature Verifier",
  "description": "Verify a C2PA COSE_Sign1 claim signature using crypto.subtle.verify (Ed25519/ES256/ES384/PS256). Trust posture is caller-supplied — zero network, no OCSP. Emits ACCEPT or REFUSE.",
